flowchart TD
    %% ---------- Input ----------
    U[User: natural-language playlist request] --> UI[Streamlit dashboard or CLI]
    UI --> ORCH[create_playlist orchestrator]

    %% ---------- Interpretation (AI with fallback) ----------
    ORCH --> GI[Gemini interpreter: structured JSON profile + constraints]
    GI -. API error, quota limit, or invalid JSON .-> FB[Local keyword interpreter]
    GI --> PV{Python validation: clamp numbers, check genres, moods, languages, years against the active catalog}
    FB --> PV
    PV --> PF[Validated profile: activity, length 1-50, mood, energy, tempo, structure, language and year constraints, bounded priorities]

    %% ---------- Data ----------
    CSV[(Fictional songs.csv)] --> CV{CSV type, range, and duplicate-ID guardrails}
    RCSV[(Real songs: real_songs.csv)] --> CV
    BLD[build_real_catalog.py: ReccoBeats features, Deezer covers, filters, derived mood] -. built once, reviewed by a person .-> RCSV
    LANG[Gemini language estimate at build time, rule fallback, manual overrides] -. labels language column .-> RCSV

    %% ---------- Deterministic selection ----------
    PF --> HF{Hard filters: language or years marked 'only'}
    CV --> HF
    HF --> SE[Python scoring: energy, graded mood and genre similarity, tempo, soft language and recency]
    SE --> PG[Sequencer: energy arc, artist diversity, ID tie-breaks]
    HF -. too few songs .-> SW[Visible shortage warning with counts]

    %% ---------- Explanations ----------
    PG --> GX[Gemini explanations for selected songs only]
    GX --> EV{Every selected ID covered?}
    GX -. failure .-> DR[Deterministic score reasons]
    EV --> OUT[Ordered playlist, scores, warnings, AI or fallback labels]
    DR --> OUT
    SW --> OUT

    %% ---------- Catalog chatbot (RAG) ----------
    Q[User question in Ask tab or --ask] --> QP[Gemini or offline parser: structured query]
    QP --> QV{Python query validation: known fields, filters, limits}
    QV --> RET[Python retrieval from catalog and current playlist]
    OUT --> RET
    RET --> GA[Gemini phrases an answer from retrieved records only]
    GA --> CC{Citation check: cited IDs retrieved, numbers match, every match covered, asked values present}
    CC -->|passes| ANS[AI answer with sources]
    CC -->|fails| DET[Deterministic catalog lookup]
    QV -. lyrics, biography, trivia .-> REF[Honest refusal]

    %% ---------- Oversight ----------
    OUT --> SC{Dashboard system checks: IDs exist, metadata matches, unique, length, determinism}
    SC --> HR[Human review: listener choice, Details panel, language overrides]
    ANS --> HR
    DET --> HR
    ORCH --> LOG[Logging: each step, counts, timing; keys redacted]
    OUT --> TEST[Automated tests and evaluation.py]
    ANS --> TEST
